branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #124379 \n- Users would see [Storyboard > Image Scale Mode](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_editorexportplatformios.html#class-editorexportplatformios-property-storyboard-image-scale-mode) set to \"Same as Logo\", and this would imply using the `application/boot_splash/stretch_mode` setting (which defaults to `SPLASH_STRETCH_MODE_KEEP` - docs say \"Stretches image to fullscreen while preserving aspect ratio.\") - but testing found that it would not do this\n\n## Additional information\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\n\n- `_process_config_file_line` was looking at `application/boot_splash/fullsize` which was removed in #109596  (this caused a warning on export)\n- moved the logic from `get_custom_project_settings` to a util `_get_launch_screen_image_mode` for reuse.\n\n## AI declaration\n\nI used AI to find the cause in export_plugin.cpp, trace it to #109596, and suggest the fix. I reviewed the change, tested it on the MRP and on device, and wrote this PR.\n\n## Demo\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1621a2df-8bc1-42aa-834f-6bede656d4d4\n\n\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archi